config HOLO_RAM_KQ
    tristate "HoloRAM kernel/user queue device"
    depends on MMU
    help
      Experimental HoloRAM kernel/user queue device.
      Provides /dev/holoram_kq for daemon-assisted exact or approximate memory operations.

config HOLO_RAM_ZSWAP
    tristate "HoloRAM exact zswap backend"
    depends on HOLO_RAM_KQ && ZSWAP
    help
      Experimental exact/lossless zswap backend using HoloRAM handles.
      Approximate-only QH modes must not be used here.
